# CompliQ AI Compliance Chatbot — Walkthrough

## Summary

Implemented a full agentic AI compliance chatbot on top of the existing Phase 1 RAG + report-generation architecture. The chatbot uses a ReAct-style agent loop with tool calling, proper memory architecture, authorization-enforced data access, comprehensive tracing, and failure recovery.

**No existing functionality was broken** — all existing endpoints (`/api/ai/workflow/`, `/api/compliance-report`, `/api/auth/`, `/api/documents/`) remain unchanged.

